// CHECKOUT PROMENADE — BROWSING BOSSA — one song: what it plays, how it is arranged, how it sounds.
//
// CHECKOUT PROMENADE as a lounge bossa nova — a game alternate of shop, selectable from
// the dev menu (GAME ALTERNATES) and on the desk. Nothing replaces the live song.
// 
// Peter: "a remix / version of the shopping theme with better sounds. Make it very
// natural sounding with bossa nova style and acoustic guitars and realistic piano and
// metallic tuned percussion. And organs. Still want a Wii shop channel feeling/vibe."
// 
// The tune is the shop's, note for note (shop.js lead, bars 7–14), with its own harmony
// line and twinkle. Its chords are the shop's chords lane, one every half bar, voiced as
// bossa guitar shapes with the colour the tune already implies:
//   A  | C6/9  Am11 | Dm9  G13 |      (twice)
//   B  | Fmaj9 Em7 | Am7  Dm9 G13 |   (twice; G13 on beat four, the shop's turnaround)
// 108 BPM, swing 54. Bossa bass (dotted quarter + eighth, root then fifth), nylon comping
// on the clave (0 3 6 10 13) with an alternate strum, cross-stick on the two-bar clave,
// brush swish, pedal hat, shaker, a felt kick; congas in the bridge and the return.
// 
//   1–4    intro — nylon guitar alone; bass, cross-stick, shaker and celesta at bar 3
//   5–8    A — VIBES have the tune, an octave up
//   9–12   B — PIANO has the tune; the vibes answer with the shop's harmony line; organ pad
//   13–16  A — vibes, the marimba on the harmony line, the celesta twinkle
//   17–20  B — piano and vibes an octave apart; organ pad
//   21–28  BRIDGE — the ORGAN has the tune at half speed, a chord a bar; the vibes
//          noodle chord tones round it; congas
//   29–40  RETURN, fuller — A B A: vibes over piano, marimba harmony, organ, steel-string
//          picking in the A's, celesta, congas
//   41–44  wind-down — the piano alone on B, the vibes answering, cross-stick and shaker
//   45–48  the guitar and the vibes on the A phrase, the vibes' pickup back into bar 5
// 
// The loop is bars 5–48. Unrendered and unlevelled: lane gains are set by reasoning.
// 48 bars at 108, 107 s. Written by work/local/_shop-remix-bossa.mjs
// through work/local/_remix-lib.mjs; re-running it rewrites this file.
//
// The music below is the composition. Everything under THE DESK WRITES BELOW HERE
// is written by `npm run mixer` and will be rewritten on every save — put notes
// about the song up here, where they survive.
